## Reviewer points not applied (disagreements)

- a#12 and the “one sentence per line / zero-width spacer” pattern. That layout is the English source. Q16–Q20 are not headings there either. New headings or deleted ZWSP lines fail the checker. The Thai lines were not treated as a translation error to be reblocked.
- b#6, same reason. The spacers are not a Thai-only leak.
- a#6 is a real readability gap (“M” is not Thai), but the bio figure is pinned. Not reformatted. This is a skip rule, not a claim that the reviewer misread the amount.
- a#2’s suggested label with no digit. The act name was wrong; dropping “10” is not possible while the English anchor still contains Article 10. “(มาตรา 10)” stays after the corrected description. The Business Tax Act name was not restored, and the URL was not changed.
- 008 “นาย B เป็นลูกจ้างที่ทำยอดได้ดีที่สุดในภาคกลาง” was left. It is the male employee’s sales rank in the anecdote, not a firm superlative, and it was not a finding. นาย B stays male.

